@startuml
actor "管理员" as admin
participant "论坛管理界面" as forumPage
database "系统记录" as systemRecords
participant "系统" as system

activate admin
admin -> forumPage: 进入论坛管理界面
activate forumPage

admin -> forumPage: 输入关键字进行模糊查询
forumPage -> system: 管理员输入查询关键字请求
activate system

system -> systemRecords: 模糊查询论坛内容列表
activate systemRecords
systemRecords --> system: 论坛内容列表结果
deactivate systemRecords

admin -> forumPage: 选择某一论坛
forumPage -> system: 管理员选择论坛请求
activate system

system -> systemRecords: 获取论坛详细信息
activate systemRecords
systemRecords --> system: 详细信息结果
deactivate systemRecords

admin -> forumPage: 查看论坛评论内容
forumPage -> system: 管理员查看评论请求
activate system

system -> systemRecords: 获取评论内容
activate systemRecords
systemRecords --> system: 评论内容结果
deactivate systemRecords

admin -> forumPage: 删除评论
forumPage -> system: 管理员删除评论请求
activate system

system -> systemRecords: 处理评论删除
activate systemRecords
systemRecords --> system: 处理结果
deactivate systemRecords

admin -> forumPage: 删除整个论坛内容
forumPage -> system: 管理员删除论坛请求
activate system

system -> systemRecords: 处理论坛删除
activate systemRecords
systemRecords --> system: 处理结果
deactivate systemRecords

deactivate admin
deactivate system
@enduml
